; Every name the textual parser dispatches natively is reserved and may not be
; claimed via --external-directive.  This test registers each built-in directive
; name and asserts it is rejected, so is_reserved_directive_name() in
; textual_directives.cc cannot silently drift out of sync with the
; general_directive() and read_next_directive() dispatch switches.

2024/01/01 Opening
    Assets:Checking    $100.00
    Equity:Opening

test --external-directive account:line bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing option '--external-directive'
Error: Cannot register reserved directive name 'account' as an external directive
end test

